# Feature 087: webapp-backend's own writable data root (comments/mappings/notes) — a
# single shared folder (no per-env subfolder; Rapaport maintains one dataset, not separate
# dev/prod copies), seeded from Rapaport's live analyst files, real client data. Never
# committed — same rationale as denidin-app/dev_data and denidin-app/data.
webapp_data/*
!webapp_data/README.md
# Ad hoc, per-clone scratch copy for local prod-data preview sessions (see
# config.prod-local-preview.json) - isolates preview edits from the real folder above.
webapp_data_preview/
